# Common Mistakes Log

The agent must maintain a project-specific common mistakes log.

When the agent makes an avoidable mistake, misunderstands the project, breaks working behavior, repeats an already-solved issue, or takes an incorrect approach that should not happen again, it must record the mistake in:

```txt
.agent/rules/common-mistakes.mdc